  "review": "<h2 id=\"intro\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【静岡県】蓬莱屋旅館の魅力と宿泊満足度</h2>\n\n<p class=\"text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">静岡県・東伊豆熱川温泉の海沿いに静かに佇む「蓬莱屋旅館（ほうらいや）」は、豊富な自家源泉と新鮮な伊豆の海鮮料理で愛され続ける老舗温泉旅館です。</p>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-6\">相模湾を臨む大浴場で熱川の名湯を存分に堪能でき、伊豆名物「特大金目鯛の姿煮」を丸ごと一匹あしらった豪華海鮮会席が至福の夕食をお届けします。</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"hotel-card\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 my-6\">🏨 熱川温泉 蓬莱屋旅館の温泉・客室・食事・駐車場アクセス情報</h2>\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-md space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-stone-100 pb-3\">\n    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">蓬莱屋旅館</h3>\n    <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.95 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-5/12\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/7024/7024.jpg\" alt=\"蓬莱屋旅館\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-stone-100\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-7/12 space-y-3 text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">\n      <p><strong>【都道府県】</strong> 静岡県</p>\n      <p><strong>【エリア】</strong> 東伊豆・河津</p>\n      <p><strong>【温泉・風呂】</strong> 熱川温泉の自家源泉。相模湾を望む天然温泉大浴場＆風情ある露天風呂。</p>\n      <p><strong>【駐車場】</strong> 敷地内無料駐車場完備（約20台・熱川駅徒歩約5分）。</p>\n      <p><strong>【お食事】</strong> 伊豆特産「特大金目鯛の姿煮」や伊勢海老、新鮮お刺身盛り合わせを味わう豪華和食海鮮会席。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F7024%2F7024.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-extrabold text-sm rounded-